  "title": "End of Course Survey",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "You have now completed your journey through "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "REAL CHEM II"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "! This final survey will ask you questions about how you feel about chemistry and your personal experiences in this chemistry course. You will recall some of these questions from a survey you completed at the start of the course. We are interested in how, if at all, your feelings may have changed. Remember that there are no right or wrong answers—you can be completely yourself and honest. Your instructor "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "will be able to view your responses. "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "You also have the option to opt out of answering any question. Thank you for taking the time!"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "474577052",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "481834202",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "People have very different attitudes toward chemistry, which can range from very positive to very critical. These next few questions ask about your opinions about chemistry at this moment in time. Importantly, we are interested in your feelings toward "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "chemistry topics and content"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " separate from other issues like teaching."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2624127083",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "721635522",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79274,
            "children": [],
            "id": "4285302508",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 80274,
