            "id": "3186888436",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79383,
            "children": [],
            "id": "2334150278",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Teachers and instructors are often an important component of learning about chemistry. These next few questions ask about your attitudes toward "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "REAL CHEM"
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": " "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "II "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "instructor and their teaching"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "938326568",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "4181366722",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79802,
            "children": [],
            "id": "3707405767",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79265,
            "children": [],
            "id": "764475769",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Students have various reasons for taking chemistry and different benefits that they hope to gain from learning about this topic. The next few questions ask about some of the things that you feel you may have gained from the course."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1857037681",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "882720311",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 80251,
            "children": [],
            "id": "406144717",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "These next questions ask about "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your personal experiences"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " in "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "REAL CHEM II"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", including "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your feelings "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "about yourself, your skills, the instructor, and your peers. Remember that there are no right or wrong answers—you can be completely yourself and honest. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4005855695",
                "type": "p"
              }
